Order for Include files:

Each include file contains only defines for the specific service

co_acces.h	access to the object dictionary
co_debug.h	debug interface
co_def.h	compiler specific defines
co_drv.h	driver interface
co_emcy.h	emergency handling
co_flag.h	internal error and CAN flags
co_guard.h	node guarding usage
co_hb.h		heartbeat usage
co_lme.h	layer management
co_mcpy.h	hardware specific memcpy
co_mpdo.h	multiplexed pdo
co_nmt.h	network management
co_nmt_m.h	network management only for master
co_odidx.h	object dictionary index defines
co_pdo.h	pdo usage
co_sdo.h	sdo usage
co_sdomg.h	sdo manager usage
co_sdorq.h	sdo requester usage
co_setcp.h	set internal communication parameter
co_stor.h	store usage
co_stru.h	structure defines
co_sync.h	sync usage
co_time.h	time usage
co_type.h	type definition
co_usr.h	user interface
co_util.h	utilities
